ass=\"content\">\n      <section class=\"two-columns\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 class=\"section-heading\">INTRODUCTION</h2>\n          <div class=\"text-panel\">\n            <p>\n              Plant phenotypes are influenced by the<br>\n              constraints and dynamics of their<br>\n              interacting environment. The<br>\n              PhenoSphere at IPK in Germany<br>\n              successfully simulates field-like conditions,<br>\n              allowing analysis of plant growth<br>\n              performance under diverse weather<br>\n              scenarios.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <h2 class=\"section-heading\">METHODS</h2>\n          <div class=\"text-panel\">\n            <p>\n              Plant phenotypes are influenced by the<br>\n              constraints and dynamics of their<br>\n              interacting environment. The<br>\n              PhenoSphere at IPK in Germany<br>\n              successfully simulates field-like<br>\n              conditions, allowing analysis of plant<br>\n              growth performance under diverse<br>\n              weather scenarios.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <h2 class=\"results-title\">RESULTS</h2>\n\n      <section class=\"results-grid\">\n        <div class=\"result-panel\">\n          <p class=\"figure-title\">\n            Fig. 1: The experimental sites at the IPK<br>\n            Gatersleben.\n          </p>\n\n          <figure class=\"site-composite placeholder\" aria-label=\"Four photographs of the PhenoSphere and IPK field site\">\n            <div class=\"photo-placeholder photo-a\" data-label=\"a\">\n              <span class=\"placeholder-label\">[Photo: PhenoSphere exterior]</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"photo-placeholder photo-b\" data-label=\"b\">\n              <span class=\"placeholder-label\">[Photo: compartment 1, early growth]</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"photo-placeholder photo-d\" data-label=\"d\">\n              <span class=\"placeholder-label\">[Photo: IPK field site, 2016]</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"photo-placeholder photo-c\" data-label=\"c\">\n              <span class=\"placeholder-label\">[Photo: compartment 1, late growth]</span>\n            </div>\n          </figure>\n\n          <p class=\"photo-caption\">\n            a The PhenoSphere as seen from the<br>\n            outside. View into compartment 1 of the<br>\n            PhenoSphere early (b) and late (c) in the<br>\n            growth period. d The field 2016 at the IPK<br>\n            field site.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"result-panel result-right\">\n          <div class=\"fig-two-row\">\n            <div class=\"fig-two-text\">\n              Fig. 2: Plant heights<br>\n              and growth speeds<br>\n              over time observed in<br>\n              seven field and indoor<br>\n              environments.\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"chart-stack\">\n              <div class=\"chart-placeholder small-chart placeholder\">\n                <span class=\"chart-heading\">V - Stage</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"chart-placeholder small-chart placeholder\">\n                <span class=\"chart-heading\">Leaf maturation</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <p class=\"fig-three-text\">\n            Fig. 3: Developmental stage progression<br>\n            and leaf maturation rates over time<br>\n            observed in seven field and indoor<br>\n            environments.\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"chart-grid\" aria-label=\"Four line charts\">\n            <div class=\"chart-placeholder large-chart placeholder\">\n              <span class=\"chart-heading\">V - Stage</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"chart-placeholder large-chart placeholder\">\n              <span class=\"chart-heading\">Plants with tassel</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"chart-placeholder large-chart placeholder\">\n              <span class=\"chart-heading\">Leaf maturation</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"chart-placeholder large-chart placeholder\">\n              <span class=\"chart-heading\">Tassel occurrence</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"bottom-grid\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 class=\"bottom-heading\">CONCLUSION</h2>\n          <div class=\"bottom-panel conclusion\">\n            <p>\n              The controlled environmental conditions<br>\n              are indeed spatially highly homogeneous<br>\n              across the cultivation areas of the<br>\n              PhenoSphere.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <h2 class=\"bottom-heading\">CONTACT</h2>\n          <div class=\"bottom-panel contact\">\n            <p>Whatsapp： 861356855××××</p>\n            <p>Email： ××××0825@gmail.com</p>\n\n            <div class=\"decorative-icons placeholder\" aria-label=\"Decorative planet illustrations\">\n              <div class=\"planet\"></div>\n              <div class=\"planet\"></div>\n              <div class=\"planet\"></div>\n              <div class=\"planet\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"qr-placeholder placeholder\">\n              Your<br>\n              QR code\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"watermark\">知乎 @ENGI组织委员会 富有[?]...</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
